    "title": "$175K BOND SET FOR EACH SUSPECT IN CLAIBORNE COUNTY DEPUTY'S DEATH - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lauren Harvey Quentin Smith ,\n11 hours ago\nCLAIBORNE COUNTY, Miss. (WLBT) - A judge has set bond for the 12 people charged in the shooting death of Claiborne County Sheriff’s Deputy Terrian Bailey. After previously being denied during their initial court appearance, Judge Price Henley gave each suspect a $175,000 bond. On Sept. 7 of this...\nRead full article",
